  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Case1 Leon 2.0.0_en-GB
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-GB
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e35420d76dc76749ae17443d412c45b, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 38729146368
    m_Localized: 'You have a wife, she''s also being interrogated. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615360
    m_Localized: How has your marriage been till now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615361
    m_Localized: First, I had a wife. Second what crap do you give about my marriage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615362
    m_Localized: Like I would talk with you about it anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615363
    m_Localized: Try to get that stick up your ass out first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615364
    m_Localized: ' It''s relevant to the case. I assume you want your daughter to
      get justice.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615365
    m_Localized: It's not relevant to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615366
    m_Localized: "Empathy\_is not\_common\_these\_days. But\_don't\_you care about\_your\_own\_daughter?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615367
    m_Localized: I do you fuck. But the subject comes down to her own mother strangling
      her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615368
    m_Localized: "That's\_your precious justice..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615369
    m_Localized: 'I think you forgot what consequences those who don''t cooperate
      face.  '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615370
    m_Localized: Its not death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615371
    m_Localized: We will put you to use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615372
    m_Localized: ".\_\_ .\_\_ ."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615373
    m_Localized: "It was\_a\_happy marriage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615374
    m_Localized: Slowly destroyed by everything this world has become.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615375
    m_Localized: At some point only thing connecting us was our child Sophie.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615376
    m_Localized: "We hated\_each other."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615377
    m_Localized: 'I cared less and less about everything in face of hell we live
      in. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615378
    m_Localized: 'She was the opposite. Trying to hide the fact of the state of the
      world. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615379
    m_Localized: By her own how would you call it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615380
    m_Localized: exemplariness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615381
    m_Localized: I didn't really realize that fully. Until now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615382
    m_Localized: "Now that Sophie is gone and\_Marry too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615383
    m_Localized: Your wife Marry still lives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38825615384
    m_Localized: "She's\_an\_UnPerson.\_Not Marry. Now get off me\_already."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
